					<description><![CDATA[<img width="800" height="418" src="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team.png" class="webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image" alt="Collective team" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear:both;max-width: 100%;" link_thumbnail="" decoding="async" srcset="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team.png 800w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-300x157.png 300w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-768x401.png 768w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-380x199.png 380w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-760x397.png 760w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-600x314.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />Hooman Radfar&#8216;s parents both ran their own medical practices. When they split up, only his dad went the&#8230;]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<img width="800" height="418" src="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team.png" class="webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image" alt="Collective team" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear:both;max-width: 100%;" link_thumbnail="" decoding="async" srcset="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team.png 800w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-300x157.png 300w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-768x401.png 768w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-380x199.png 380w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-760x397.png 760w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Collective-team-600x314.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>General Catalyst is investing $60m to help Collective acquire customers.</li>



<li>Collective offers business setup, accounting, invoicing, payroll, taxes, business insurance, health insurance, and support through a single membership</li>



<li> Collective will use the capital to accelerate product development in banking and insurance.</li>
</ul>



<p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hooman" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Hooman Radfar</a>&#8216;s parents both ran their own medical practices. When they split up, only his dad went the S-corp route, which reduces self-employment taxes. Radfar says that decision saved his dad hundreds of thousands of dollars that his mum didn&#8217;t get to save. </p>



<p>That&#8217;s what inspired him to start <a href="https://www.collective.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Collective</a> to help people avoid that exact same shortfall. He&#8217;s now announced $100 million in new funding to automate that decision for solo entrepreneurs in the US.</p>



<p>The round includes a $40m Series B and $60m from <a href="https://techfundingnews.com/general-catalyst-10b-fundraise-talks/" data-type="post" data-id="62356" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">General Catalyst</a>&#8216;s Customer Value Fund (CVF). General Catalyst, QED Investors, and Gradient Ventures led the Series B, with participation from Intuit Ventures, FT Partners, and SemperVirens. </p>]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
