										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<img width="800" height="418" src="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders.png" class="webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image" alt="Crux Labs co-founders" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear:both;max-width: 100%;" link_thumbnail="" decoding="async" srcset="https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders.png 800w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders-300x157.png 300w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders-768x401.png 768w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders-380x199.png 380w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders-760x397.png 760w, https://techfundingnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Crux-Labs-co-founders-600x314.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Crux Labs has raised over $6 million, with Benchstrength and Misneach leading the round.</li>



<li>The founders have experience at Tractable, Block Renovation, Meta and Checkr.</li>



<li>Crux plans to use the funds for R&amp;D and to accelerate enterprise deployments.</li>
</ul>



<p>Most companies still manually review only 1% of their AI agent activity. <a href="https://crux-labs.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Crux Labs</a>, a New York-based startup, uses software to review the rest and is exiting stealth with over $6 million raised.</p>



<p>Benchstrength and Misneach led the oversubscribed round, with Analog Ventures and Pareto Holdings on board. </p>



<p>According to Crux Labs, its AI agents can connect to customers&#8217; tools, learn from the company&#8217;s experts, and use that knowledge to generate custom tests. They then run those tests on all production traffic, generating alerts and enabling rapid fixes for the live agents. </p>



<p>In domains like healthcare and financial services, this means applying clinicians&#8217; or compliance officers&#8217; standards to every interaction.</p>]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
